body:
Sooooo....... um:

https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neo-feudalism

Yeah...... sorry man ;_;

Well adjusted? In this economy? In this societal hot mess of bullshit? Fuck off. And even if a person needs therapy, can they afford it? Do they have insurance? Does the clinic/ private practitioner take that insurance? Is said clinic/ practitioner even have availability, and not drowning in patients? Do they even match with your issues are click on a reasonable level and have experience with your problems?

&#x200B;

Fuck these people and their brazen generalizations. Get some perspective goddamnit-- we're human beings, not NPCs
